<h1>Welcome to inline_forms!</h1>

<p>
  Create the file<br/>
  <em>app/views/devise/inline_forms/_content_for_devise_login.html.erb</em><br />
  and the contents will be displayed here.
</p>
<p>
  The titles come from the <em>application_name</em> translation; override
  inline_forms.general.application_title, inline_forms.devise.title_for_devise
  or inline_forms.devise.welcome in <em>config/locales</em> to change one.<br />
</p>
  
